{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA 6》11月19日正式上市後，<strong>部分Xbox Series X|S和PS5玩家陸續反映主機出現異常，故障包括遊戲崩潰、突然關機、無法安裝更新，嚴重時甚至完全無法開機。</strong>波蘭維修技術人員modyfikatorcasper表示，近期送修的Xbox主機明顯增多，在其收到的10台送修設備中，約有2台是Xbox，而當地Xbox的普及程度原本明顯低於PlayStation。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588186.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.683463+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:25:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_hash":"eda2513235405bb919abfadd6c2b26c60e8695c7e7469884f283acee331c2238","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}